ClickDealer is hiring a Sales Manager
ClickDealer is one of the top-5 CPA networks worldwide! Since 2012, the company has been in performance marketing, partnering with over 10,000 publishers across more than 40 verticals. HQ in the Netherlands, and over 5 offices across the globe.
If you've got 2+ years in digital marketing, know how to turn a cold lead into a long-term partner, and enjoy negotiating deals as much as closing them - let's talk!
What we expect:

• 2+ years of experience in digital marketing, with a strong sales track record;

• Fluency in written and spoken English;

• Existing relationships with clients and agencies in the industry;

• Strong work ethic and drive to exceed expectations and targets;

• An innovative, strategic mindset - you don't just sell, you build.

What you'll be doing:

• Bringing in new advertisers and building long-term partnerships with them;

• Leading sales initiatives aligned with the company's overall strategy;

• Negotiating contract terms and driving revenue growth;

• Acting as a consultant to partners - sharing market insights and global best practices;

• Acquiring new media partners and implementing products;

• Representing the company at industry events, locally and abroad;

• Keeping an up-to-date knowledge base of the online advertising landscape;

We offer:

• Competitive fixed salary + performance-driven bonuses;

• 20 paid vacation days + paid sick leave;

• 50% coverage for sports, therapy, courses, and language classes;

• Cross-team knowledge sharing - no unnecessary bureaucracy.

