About Baringa&nbsp;

Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.

The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence - all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.

Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly - all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.

Certified as a&nbsp; Great Place to Work around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the Financial Times in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by Forbes for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.

Our Digital &amp; AI practice are looking for Summer Interns to join the team.

The Internship

This is an eight-week summer internship designed to give you a real look at consulting - not from the sidelines, but by getting close to the work.&nbsp; &nbsp;

You’ll join our Digital &amp; AI practice. We help clients answer questions such as:&nbsp; &nbsp;

• How can organizations navigate digital transformation and technology adoption in a practical, people-first way?&nbsp; &nbsp;

• How can data and technology help solve complex business challenges? &nbsp;

• How can digital strategy, transformation, and its technical implementation come together to create real impact? &nbsp;

• How can organizations modernize their data architectures, governance frameworks, and workflows to support modern solutions? &nbsp;

• How can AI be used to rapidly build prototypes and proof of concepts? &nbsp; &nbsp;

In practice, that means your work could look different from week to week. You might… &nbsp;

• Help a client identify where, data, technology, or AI can save cost or increase efficiency by improving customer experience with a new help portal or making supply chain more efficient via a customized warehousing inventory tool. &nbsp;

• Support an AI or data strategy project, helping turn big ambitions into practical priorities, use cases and roadmaps. E.g. Orchestrating the logistics for launching a new internal company chat bot. &nbsp;

• Work with teams to design smarter and faster data architectures, platforms or workflows that help organizations scale new capabilities. E.g. Helping a company move from a monolithic architecture to a modular architecture. &nbsp;

• Analyze data, spot patterns and translate technical findings into clear insights that help clients make better decisions. E.g. Develop a commercial analytics dashboard to help sales representatives identify new leads and prospects. &nbsp;

• Help shape how AI-enabled solutions move beyond a proof of concept into something usable, trusted and ready for the real world. E.g. Implement robust, enterprise grade security, architecture, and platforming into a proof of concept. &nbsp;

• Support work on data governance, quality or management, helping clients create the foundations they need for reporting, analytics and AI. E.g. Create entity relationship diagrams, data flow diagrams, data dictionaries, or data catalogues. &nbsp;

